Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.59,0:00:04.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before we get things started,\Nthere's something I want to check.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.95,0:00:07.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about you go ahead\Nand shuffle those cards?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.21,0:00:21.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And, shuffled they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.19,0:00:24.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What pray tell do you have in mind next?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.11,0:00:26.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now draw a card from the deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.63,0:00:30.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which one it is doesn't really\Nmake a whole lot of difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.97,0:00:32.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But don't show anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.47,0:00:36.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.99,0:00:38.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now I'll call it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.61,0:00:39.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the Six of Hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.59,0:00:43.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next, I think I'll name the\Ncards from the top down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.23,0:00:47.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Five of Spades, Queen of Diamonds,\NJack of Spades, Ace of Hearts,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.37,0:00:51.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seven of Diamonds, plus the Six of Clubs,\NKing of Clubs, and Two of Diamonds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.57,0:00:55.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He guessed them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.95,0:00:58.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's after Darby shuffled the deck!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.47,0:00:59.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.95,0:01:02.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could rattle off the\Nentire deck if I wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.55,0:01:05.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember my request from earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.61,0:01:07.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While you were shuffling the cards,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.33,0:01:10.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Star Platinum was busy memorizing\Ntheir order in the deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.01,0:01:12.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quite the interesting strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.37,0:01:14.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That said,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.28,0:01:16.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,defeating your plan is a\Nsimple matter of shuffling the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.83,0:01:19.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cards in a manner that\Nobstructs your vision of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.61,0:01:20.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you that dense?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.25,0:01:25.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cheating is going to be damn near impossible\Nas long as you have me as an opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.57,0:01:28.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just something I thought\Nyou should be aware of.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.15,0:01:29.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.09,0:01:42.01,Title 3,title,0,0,0,,{\fad(485,472)\pos(156,871)}Episode 35: D'Arby the Gambler, Part 2
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.43,0:01:43.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The security seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.09,0:01:46.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An unbroken seal is an\Nirrefutable confirmation
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.97,0:01:50.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that the deck has not been\Ntampered with in any way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.17,0:02:03.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, there's only one Joker here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.47,0:02:04.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't see anything unusual.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.77,0:02:06.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a normal deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.99,0:02:13.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The page number is 538. 540?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.21,0:02:16.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, page 556.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.19,0:02:19.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.03,0:02:24.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My ability to discern page numbers\Nby touch is as sharp as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.83,0:02:29.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's true that Jotaro's Star Platinum\Nhas incredible visual prowess,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.27,0:02:33.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I can remember the placement of\Nanything simply through the use of touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.83,0:02:35.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shuffle them all you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.29,0:02:38.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still know the exact\Nlocation of every card.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.17,0:02:47.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, open the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.75,0:02:52.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like it's the Ten of Hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.05,0:02:54.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I drew the Seven of Clubs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.95,0:02:57.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then it seems like I'll be dealing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.95,0:03:01.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, I need to shuffle\Nso Star Platinum can't see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.35,0:03:10.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you would cut the deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.63,0:03:25.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, and now I'll deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.31,0:03:28.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One for Jotaro, one for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.17,0:03:31.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One for Jotaro, one for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.35,0:03:40.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand. What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.95,0:03:43.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro! His finger!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.67,0:03:47.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why the devil would you use Star\NPlatinum to break Darby's finger?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.37,0:03:51.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like I said, you're not going to cheat\Nwhen you're playing against me. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.01,0:03:53.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He tried to cheat?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.27,0:03:55.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he was only dealing\Nthe cards, wasn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.79,0:03:58.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't notice him do\Nanything suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.53,0:04:00.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what he wanted us to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.27,0:04:03.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but take a good look at\Nthe cards in his left hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.95,0:04:04.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.25,0:04:07.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The second card is sticking out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.93,0:04:10.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the card he tried to deal me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.13,0:04:13.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The entire time he was\Npretending to deal the top card,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.31,0:04:17.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the truth is he was dealing\Nme the second card from the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.27,0:04:21.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That being the case, it means the\Ntop card would have gone to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.79,0:04:23.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he'd gotten his hands on it,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.67,0:04:26.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the cheating bastard would\Nhave had a total of three tens.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.71,0:04:29.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This maneuver is known as the second deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.27,0:04:33.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A devious sleight-of-hand technique\Ninvolving the dealer throwing out the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.83,0:04:38.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,second card in the deck instead of\Ndealing the top card as one would expect.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.93,0:04:41.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the technique is\Nexecuted by a professional,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.83,0:04:44.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the cheat is almost\Nundetectable to the naked eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.19,0:04:46.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if that wasn't enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.07,0:04:50.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Darby can discern the location of\Nevery card in the deck by touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.89,0:04:52.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You brutish imbecile!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.31,0:04:55.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you break my finger!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.09,0:04:59.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was playing nice with that attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.45,0:05:02.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should count yourself\Nlucky I didn't rip it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.25,0:05:04.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.65,0:05:07.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I can't let you\Ncut the deck anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.27,0:05:10.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone else is going\Nto do it from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.25,0:05:13.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That boy on the hill looks up to the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.43,0:05:16.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have it your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.35,0:05:20.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Avdol, ask him over right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.95,0:05:22.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Most impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.25,0:05:25.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Successful cheating requires\Nthe element of surprise,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.07,0:05:29.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and it takes more than\Nsharp eyes to prevent that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.59,0:05:33.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It appears I underestimated you\Nas you saw through my second deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.69,0:05:36.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll accept my fractured\Nfinger as proper punishment,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.23,0:05:41.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but from here on I'll devote my full\Nconcentration to winning the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.53,0:05:43.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.05,0:05:48.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've not done so since my\Ncolossal gamble on May 17th, 1986.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.67,0:05:53.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was playing against a Japanese\Nman known as Chase Mayama as the
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.77,0:05:57.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,victor my spoils included his eight\NTokyo properties and his soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.73,0:06:02.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will say this for Mayama wealth\Ndidn't dull his gambler's instincts.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.09,0:06:08.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's only fair that I warn you I'm\Nnot here on behalf of Lord Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.65,0:06:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am here due to the simple\Nfact that I am a born gambler.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.51,0:06:15.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're\Ndoing those souls are mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.07,0:06:17.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe stars and Bulgarefs
