Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.91,0:06:31.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've done nothing more than split\Ntheir souls into six chips each.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.77,0:06:33.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you know this, but in poker,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.03,0:06:38.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you're on the verge of losing,\Nit's perfectly acceptable to fold.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.49,0:06:39.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.40,0:06:41.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you use up all the chips for the ante,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.57,0:06:43.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's no way to bet and\Nthe game doesn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.05,0:06:45.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To put it plainly,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.59,0:06:50.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,winning back six chips is the equivalent\Nof winning the soul of one of your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.29,0:06:51.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Makes sense?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.05,0:06:53.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right then, Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.99,0:06:58.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you still want to play, you'll have\Nthe opportunity to win back the chips.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.13,0:07:01.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But before that, I need\Nto hear you say the words.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.35,0:07:05.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.65,0:07:07.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll bet my soul on the game's outcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.23,0:07:09.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.71,0:07:10.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.03,0:07:17.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pure white chips in front of you are\Na physical representation of your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.27,0:07:23.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once I procured all six of those chips,\Nyour soul will be added to my collection.
