Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.91,0:07:47.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For my opening action, I shall\Nbet one chip of Polnareff's soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.21,0:07:51.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.73,0:07:56.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When beginning a new game of poker, each\Nplayer is dealt a total of five cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.77,0:07:59.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Players can improve their\Nhand by swapping out cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.49,0:08:04.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though it seems\Nstraightforward on the surface,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.07,0:08:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's the betting aspect that makes poker\Na game of determination and psychology.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.99,0:08:12.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, what to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.07,0:08:14.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, I think I'll raise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.19,0:08:21.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, you should bear in mind that\Nthose six chips beside you are your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.33,0:08:25.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make sure you think carefully\Nbefore making a move.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.51,0:08:29.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, it's okay if you don't\Nunderstand what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.99,0:08:31.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.25,0:08:35.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just focus your attention on\Ncutting and dealing the cards, alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.07,0:08:37.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me three cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.23,0:08:46.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you look at that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.79,0:08:48.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such a serious glare.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.63,0:08:51.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behind it must be an outstanding hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.65,0:08:55.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose I'll play it safe for\Nnow and bet one more Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.69,0:08:56.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Call one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.09,0:09:01.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't fold, you'll need three\Nchips per game at the very least.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.79,0:09:04.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, bring it on, Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.15,0:09:09.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two pair with eights and nines.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.67,0:09:11.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, that's too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.59,0:09:14.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two pair, jacks and queens.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.25,0:09:17.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.81,0:09:19.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My, that was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.59,0:09:21.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was on the verge of a crushing defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.77,0:09:26.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But as it stands...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.27,0:09:37.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He only has three left.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.45,0:09:39.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, what are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.43,0:09:42.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, next game. Deal the cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.15,0:09:53.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should be careful what you wish for.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.87,0:09:56.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The next game may well be your last.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.73,0:10:03.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll change one card.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.61,0:10:18.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the problem, Jotaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.89,0:10:21.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and check your\Nhands so you can make
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.11,0:10:23.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a decision as to whether\Nyou'll change or fold.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.85,0:10:24.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jotaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.13,0:10:28.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.55,0:10:30.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These cards will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.13,0:10:35.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So sorry. Come again?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.41,0:10:36.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There must be some confusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.91,0:10:38.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I misheard you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.91,0:10:41.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could have sworn I heard\Nyou say these cards will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.75,0:10:42.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you heard right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.01,0:10:44.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm fine with these cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.69,0:10:46.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll play the round with this hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.57,0:10:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Obviously!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.48,0:10:49.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What I'm trying to ask is,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.89,0:10:54.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do you intend to play those cards\Nwithout so much as glancing at them?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.35,0:10:55.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These cards will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.23,0:10:59.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough subterfuge! Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.17,0:11:01.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you play a round\Nwith any sort of confidence
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.33,0:11:03.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you don't even look at\Nthe cards in your hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.63,0:11:04.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Need a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.89,0:11:05.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You in?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.47,0:11:07.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Favor?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.38,0:11:09.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, but answer something first.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.85,0:11:12.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you hell-bent on\Nnot looking at your cards?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.35,0:11:13.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it, Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.45,0:11:15.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I demand that you answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.23,0:11:16.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.33,0:11:17.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Raise you another two.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.41,0:11:24.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While I'm at it, I'll\Nthrow in Avdol's soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.83,0:11:26.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.53,0:11:32.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I admit, you're an\Nimpressive opponent, Darby.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.97,0:11:35.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, you're no match for\Nour stands physically.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.45,0:11:38.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But under pressure, you can\Nbe amazingly calm and clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.97,0:11:42.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Suffice it to say, I'm not much\Nin terms of being a gambler.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.11,0:11:44.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'd be easy for you\Nto read me like a book.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.97,0:11:47.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I could never defeat someone like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.47,0:11:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I have the utmost\Nconfidence in Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.39,0:11:54.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know why he won't look at his\Ncards, but that's none of my concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.73,0:11:58.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he asks for my soul, I won't\Nhesitate to put my life on the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.73,0:12:01.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My soul is in Jotaro's\Nmore than capable hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.45,0:12:04.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's how we're playing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.29,0:12:09.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's become apparent\Nthat the two of you have
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.69,0:12:12.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,succumbed to the pressure\Nof our little game.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.41,0:12:15.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You there, I believe\Nyou owe me another card.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.33,0:12:17.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry and deal me. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.61,0:12:28.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I dealt just as you asked, Master Darby.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.21,0:12:32.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His hand is worthless,\Nthere's no doubt about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.45,0:12:34.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My skills as a dealer never fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.73,0:12:36.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've won.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.87,0:12:38.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.35,0:12:42.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro's under the assumption the\Nboy has nothing to do with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.67,0:12:45.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But little does he know\Neveryone in this cafe
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.17,0:12:47.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and within sight of\Nthis place works for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.65,0:12:50.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even the bartender and those men.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.23,0:12:57.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what, I can't fail, as my directive\Nis to make sure Jotaro's hand is weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.45,0:13:00.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still, not looking at the\Ncards was a bold move.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.71,0:13:03.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He cut me by surprise, albeit briefly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.03,0:13:05.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's clearly a bluff.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.19,0:13:08.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare he bluff against me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.43,0:13:11.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does the fool really think I'll fold?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.97,0:13:13.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.33,0:13:18.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's your game, I'll match\Nyou with six Polnareff chips.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.73,0:13:21.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I raise you Joseph's soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.85,0:13:23.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.17,0:13:25.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fifteen chips total.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.73,0:13:27.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.64,0:13:28.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.56,0:13:29.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.49,0:13:32.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you raise your auntie when\NJotaro doesn't have any more chips?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.59,0:13:34.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's out of chips, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.65,0:13:36.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's an easy way to fix that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.71,0:13:37.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.05,0:13:40.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rectifying your chip conundrum is simple,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.21,0:13:42.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as long as my stand\Nhas a written contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.19,0:13:46.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once the deal is done, it'll\Nhave Card blanche to take a soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.57,0:13:49.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And exactly whose soul\Nare you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.13,0:13:51.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakuane's in the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.63,0:13:53.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you simply bed his soul?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.73,0:13:55.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.64,0:13:56.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Panic, fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.07,0:13:58.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show me your doubt and fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.13,0:14:01.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me see you lose that cool composure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.43,0:14:04.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare he try to bluff me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.63,0:14:06.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After I'm finished with him,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.45,0:14:10.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that poker face will be a contorted\Nball of anguish and misery.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.73,0:14:11.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.19,0:14:15.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see your bed with Kakyoin's soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.97,0:14:19.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, Jotaro, you can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.97,0:14:22.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bedding a man's soul without\Nhis knowledge is so uncouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.03,0:14:24.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it is kind of selfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.25,0:14:30.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jotaro, what did you just do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.85,0:14:32.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did I just do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.71,0:14:34.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.21,0:14:35.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You lit a cigarette!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.31,0:14:39.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.73,0:14:41.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not feeling well or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.99,0:14:46.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Impertinent!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.90,0:14:48.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is he so confident?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.13,0:14:50.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could he have...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.19,0:14:54.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could he have used Star Platinum to\Nswap the cards without my knowing?
