Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.93,0:15:14.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stupid brat, what are you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.17,0:15:17.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't look at me with\Nthat worried grimace.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.37,0:15:21.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Jotaro finds out you work\Nfor me, I'll murder you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.83,0:15:29.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Compose yourself, I have four kings.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.65,0:15:32.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only hands that could\Nbeat me are four aces,
Dialogue: 1,0:15:31.30,0:15:37.93,SC 35 Cards,cards,0,0,0,,{\blur1\pos(1660,192)}Four Aces
Dialogue: 1,0:15:32.55,0:15:37.93,SC 35 Cards,cards,0,0,0,,{\blur1\pos(1660,450)}Straight Flush
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.05,0:15:36.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a straight flush, or a\Njoker-led five-of-a-kind.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:34.22,0:15:37.93,SC 35 Cards,card,0,0,0,,{\blur1\pos(1660,708)}Five of a Kind
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.43,0:15:40.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In order to get his mitts\Non any of those hands,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.57,0:15:43.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro would have to\Nswitch all five cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.21,0:15:44.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A challenge indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.09,0:15:49.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With Star Platinum's speed, there's a\Nchance he could have switched a card.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.25,0:15:50.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But five?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.21,0:15:54.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could he really do that right\Nunder my nose? Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.55,0:15:58.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way I could have\Nmissed him replacing all five.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.81,0:16:04.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the great Darby, the king of\Ngames, master at the art of gambling.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.03,0:16:06.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had enough of this, Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.25,0:16:08.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your time has come.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.09,0:16:13.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He lit that cigarette to psych me\Nout, so now I know he's bluffing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.23,0:16:20.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.57,0:16:21.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got a drink too?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.87,0:16:24.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When did you have a\Nchance to, you bastard?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.63,0:16:26.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you make fun of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.31,0:16:27.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's finish this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.59,0:16:29.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My hand is unbeatable. Hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.81,0:16:34.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you jumping the gun when\NI haven't raised the pot yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.49,0:16:39.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Raise the pot?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.77,0:16:42.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you don't have\Nanything to raise it with.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.91,0:16:47.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's where you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.35,0:16:50.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll raise you my mother's soul. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.15,0:16:52.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you out of your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.97,0:16:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojuro, why would you\Nbet your mother's soul?
