Dialogue: 2,0:16:59.89,0:16:59.93,SFXPurp,3,0,0,0,,{=0}{\bord0\fscx102.34\fscy102.34\blur0.82\frz34.32\pos(1697.59,875.38)\4a&HFF&}Bang
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.91,0:17:03.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The entire reason I came to Egypt in\Nthe first place was to save my mother.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:59.93,0:16:59.97,SFXPurp,3,0,0,0,,{=0}{\bord10.1\fscx101.02\fscy101.02\blur0.81\frz34.32\pos(1633.14,830.7)\c&H0F0D17&}Bang
Dialogue: 2,0:16:59.93,0:16:59.97,SFXPurp,3,0,0,0,,{=0}{\bord0\fscx101.02\fscy101.02\blur0.81\frz34.32\pos(1633.14,830.7)\4a&HFF&}Bang
Dialogue: 1,0:16:59.97,0:17:00.01,SFXPurp,3,0,0,0,,{=0}{\bord10.06\fscx100.59\fscy100.59\blur0.8\frz34.32\pos(1669.04,890.92)\c&H0F0D17&}Bang
Dialogue: 2,0:16:59.97,0:17:00.01,SFXPurp,3,0,0,0,,{=0}{\bord0\fscx100.59\fscy100.59\blur0.8\frz34.32\pos(1669.04,890.92)\4a&HFF&}Bang
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.81,0:17:06.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So if I end up losing\Nhere, she'll die anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.51,0:17:08.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She won't mind if I bet her soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.85,0:17:09.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So then, Darby,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.99,0:17:14.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for your sake, I hope you have something\Nto bet that matches my mother's soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.51,0:17:15.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.43,0:17:20.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For your auntie, I want you to\Ntell me the secret of Dio Stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.69,0:17:27.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Judging from his reaction,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.91,0:17:30.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He indeed knows Dio's secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.45,0:17:34.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately for him, Dio\Ndoesn't take treason sitting down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.11,0:17:38.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he tells us the information we\Nwant to know, he's as good as dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.65,0:17:41.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.56,0:17:44.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you're confident enough\Nto bet your mother's soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.15,0:17:46.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're sure your hand\Nwill win, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.61,0:17:48.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't let us down, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.03,0:17:51.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got the winning hand, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.43,0:17:52.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.93,0:18:01.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, are you going\Nto call my bluff or fold?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.97,0:18:05.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Decision time, spit it out already. Jar B!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.89,0:18:16.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.59,0:18:25.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll say it, Darmot!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.37,0:18:32.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll say it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.97,0:18:34.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the world's greatest gambler!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.99,0:18:36.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.37,0:18:37.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll call!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.77,0:18:48.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to call!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.67,0:18:51.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Call!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.65,0:19:19.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.35,0:19:20.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm petrified.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.35,0:19:23.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm too terrified to say the words!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.87,0:19:27.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.05,0:19:29.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't breathe!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.41,0:19:41.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.09,0:19:44.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His eyes rolled into the back of his head!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.93,0:19:48.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How is it possible for someone to\Nfaint while they're on their feet?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.29,0:19:49.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's completely lost it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.17,0:19:51.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pressure was too much
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.75,0:19:58.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.66,0:20:00.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar and Polnareff's souls\Nare returning to their bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.07,0:20:01.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank heavens
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.29,0:20:07.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mentally he's already forfeited the game
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.09,0:20:10.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deep down he knew he had lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.43,0:20:12.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why the souls were released
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.47,0:20:14.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Four kings!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.93,0:20:17.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you telling me he\Nhad four kings all along?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.29,0:20:23.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, I have to know what cards you had\Nin your hand to inspire such confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.71,0:20:27.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like I thought.
