Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.71,0:20:32.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your hand was shit, absolute shit!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:29.72,0:20:29.76,SFXSun,4,0,0,0,,{\blur0.9\fscx130\fscy100\fade(255,0,255,-460,-360,60,60)\frz352.7\pos(1653,229.6)\c&H080A0D&}Stagger
