Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.13,0:20:35.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even with Star Platinum's\Nincredible speed,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.65,0:20:37.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he wouldn't have been able to swap cards?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.15,0:20:39.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in front of an expert gambler like Darby.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.19,0:20:41.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a good thing my\Nbluff and intimidation
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.23,0:20:44.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,worked so well with such a worthless hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.39,0:20:47.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good grief, had I known it was\Nthis crappy, I would have freaked.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.43,0:20:48.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.34,0:20:49.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean you'd have freaked?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.71,0:20:53.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, don't tell me that you bet\Nour souls on that worthless hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.07,0:21:13.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would appear as though his\Ncollection of souls has been released.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.05,0:21:15.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.59,0:21:17.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's play a game of Mahjong!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.11,0:21:19.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Backgammon is a lot of fun, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.15,0:21:23.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or we can play a game of dice,\Neven though I don't have any!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:24.03,0:21:27.28,SC 35 D'Arby Retire,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(274,265)\pos(1398,790)}D'Arby, User of Osiris: Retired
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.33,0:21:26.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Darby of the Osiris Stand! Retired!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.31,0:21:32.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I doubt that we'll be able to pry\NDio's secret out of him in this state.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.53,0:21:33.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.44,0:21:35.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was a formidable opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.31,0:21:38.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's humbling to admit this, but he\Nalmost took us all out single-handedly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.91,0:21:41.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The guy was a force to be reckoned with.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.17,0:21:43.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indeed, he was a fierce adversary.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.63,0:21:45.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh, I feel like death warmed over.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.71,0:21:49.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess we can't be\Nthe heroes in every episode.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.19,0:22:17.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.21,0:22:53.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
